    <text><paragraph>New patient visit for thirst, frequent urination, tiredness and weight loss in a 35-year-old monk told of diabetes a year ago and never tested: examination, random glucose and urine tests, and planning of fasting tests to confirm and classify diabetes; long-standing insomnia; raised blood pressure [S]</paragraph></text>

